I, I think we found them.

285
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,240
I think we found them.

286
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:15,760
Origami, I'll ask you one more time.

287
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:18,640
Is there no way we can make things right between us?

288
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:20,140
I'd rather die!

289
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:24,020
My resolve will not change, and my mission remains the same.

290
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:25,700
Death to all spirits!

291
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:27,580
Every single one of them!

292
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:28,940
Fine, then.

293
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,280
I appear to have no choice.

294
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:36,500
Prepare yourself, foolish child.

295
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,200
Your punishment's at hand.

296
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,540
I've heard about enough of your bullshit!

297
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,800
Sandalphon!

298
00:16:44,260 --> 00:16:45,340
Halvan Heleth!

299
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:46,600
Metatron!

300
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:47,800
Artalif!

301
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:52,440
Both of you!

302
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,180
Stop it!

303
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,400
Shido!

304
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:58,440
What are you thinking?

305
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:01,020
Please explain to me why you would do this!

306
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:01,660
Toka!

307
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:02,520
Origami!

308
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,120
Origami, come back!

309
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,080
Origami!

310
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:13,160
Origami!

311
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:34,000
I did this.

312
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:46,120
I may be a spirit, but...

313
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:50,760
The me I am now is finally capable of killing them.

314
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:56,460
Not just Toka Yatogami either, but Ifrit and Nightmare too!

315
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:01,700
Could it be true?

316
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:04,880
What if I really could make that happen?

317
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:07,500
I see.

318
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:10,040
So Origami's a spirit now.

319
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:10,700
I mean...

320
00:18:11,540 --> 00:18:13,500
I don't really know all the details.

321
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:17,120
By the time she came back, she was already...

322
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:18,780
It's okay.

323
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:19,680
You should rest.

324
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:19,920
Hmm.

325
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:30,660
Are you okay?

326
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:31,780
Wow!

327
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,260
You really took a beating!

328
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:34,940
Nah, for real.

329
00:18:35,100 --> 00:18:35,700
I'm good.

330
00:18:36,180 --> 00:18:36,860
Big sigh.

331
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,200
Kaguya's faking it.

332
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:41,100
Shut up, Yuzuru! I'm perfectly fine!

333
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:46,360
I'm ugly and worthless and dirty like a steaming pile of trash.

334
00:18:46,740 --> 00:18:49,800
But trash can be recycled, so I'm actually worse than trash.

335
00:18:50,700 --> 00:18:53,140
She used a bunch of her power doing first aid.

336
00:18:55,460 --> 00:18:57,480
Miku, don't push yourself.

337
00:18:58,580 --> 00:19:01,420
It's really sweet of you to be so worried about me, darling.

338
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:05,840
But as long as I have some power, I still have a job to do.

339
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,680
What job is that?

340
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,820
Gabriel, now Requiem!

341
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:15,120
Hello and welcome, ladies and gentlemen!

342
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:19,400
You're in for a real treat with tonight's special show!

343
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:21,940
Miku Izuyo, now on stage!

344
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:40,800
Oh, amazement. It's like my pain is fading away.

345
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:46,200
This song's especially for pain relief. Not that it actually accomplishes all that much.

346
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:50,640
Thanks for that, Miku.

347
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:54,440
I know. Let's get you to the hospital while the song's still working.

348
00:19:55,140 --> 00:19:55,960
Can you walk, Toka?

349
00:19:55,960 --> 00:20:04,140
I have to seal her, don't I?

350
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:08,620
If the AST are able to detect her, they might sound the alarm.

351
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,120
What's bothering you, Shido?

352
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:13,080
Nothing!

353
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:14,580
But, uh, got a sec?

354
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:18,860
Are you okay? What are you doing?

355
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,040
Um, well, it's just...

356
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:25,500
Oh, I see.

357
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:30,400
So what you're saying is that right now, right here, we're gonna have to kiss?

358
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,540
Um, I...

359
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:34,540
Yeah, I think we kind of have to.

360
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:37,580
Hey, Shido.

361
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:51,720
I can't see anything.

362
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,760
Shh, you have to be quiet.

363
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,300
Could you please stop moving?

364
00:20:55,780 --> 00:20:56,900
Where'd Shido go?

365
00:20:56,900 --> 00:21:03,100
Everyone okay?

366
00:21:04,780 --> 00:21:05,860
My goodness.

367
00:21:06,180 --> 00:21:07,380
Itsuka? Yarugami?

368
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:09,440
Uh, hi, Miss Tamae.

369
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:11,840
Whoa! What a hideous injury!

370
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:12,680
Huh?

371
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:15,600
I'm afraid you need the hospital, not the infirmary.

372
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,520
Hold tight while I make the call.

373
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,720
Huh?

374
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:27,940
君と最後の約束をしよう

375
00:21:27,940 --> 00:21:39,800
ooked by you

376
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:51,800
He needs my mind

377
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:59,880
I want you to stay

378
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:04,440
ㅡ

379
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:10,140
ずっとここで君と二人で

380
00:22:10,140 --> 00:22:15,380
妖様流れる

381
00:22:15,380 --> 00:22:18,440
星を見続けたい

382
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:23,540
君と最後の約束をしよう

383
00:22:23,540 --> 00:22:30,180
世界から私だけ消えてしまっても

384
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:35,760
I'll ExperiAV ترك انه

385
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:38,420
Backing you with this feeling

386
00:22:38,420 --> 00:22:44,140
And forever

387
00:23:00,180 --> 00:23:22,660
My, my, my.

388
00:23:22,660 --> 00:23:26,000
What a strange and unexpected customer we have tonight.

389
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:32,000
It's so very nice to see you, Origami.

